    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "elisabeth seguin",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104299969979766031301/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUipED-VsGoGhAjuBkB6fc9yFNFQ9_t4FVEQXf0c74DhPGsCwM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Phillip is incredibly meticulous and methodical, with a clear focus on understanding the root cause of the issue rather than just treating symptoms. Every session feels purposeful and tailored, and it’s obvious the is genuinely invested in helping you get better. He takes the time to explain what he’s doing, tracks progress carefully, and adjusts the treatment plan as needed. I always leave feeling heard, supported, and confident that I’m in expert hands. If you’re looking for someone who is thorough, thoughtful, and truly committed to your recovery, I highly recommend him!",
        "time": 1765729168,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Alexander Meehan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115436342709810003478/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJwuaLGW6HePcHdzV5HksDlhYXUorCJjcb730MtPZPI9oZPog=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Came here for the first time in November for a knee tendinitis. Easy to find, ample parking and an elevator. I was met by Philippe who was very professional and knowledgeable. He quickly got to work to find out exactly what was going on, doing adjustments and giving me exercises to do at home. Philippe put me at ease right away, he likes to connect with his clients and find points in common. I'll definitely come back here should something else arise, thanks Philippe!",
        "time": 1748294588,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Stephanie Brien",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112163912075418912019/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKK52I1ECDOYOapaViBvGcF6T4yXyQySwmOJtYFInEP_sSIJw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "I received great care and appreciated the ease of scheduling online and claims submitted directly to my insurance company.",
        "time": 1759604360,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Dylan Rawlings-Caron",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101598093974394334480/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIXZPipHgHW1k4FRtPQjkgavil6dxwBbZFAZkf0QhnUM2CGA4U=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "Shoutout to the most excellent physiotherapy team I’ve ever seen. Thank you Hayley. Thank you Anick. Thank you Amélie. You are helpful, welcoming, and have worked miracles on my (many) injuries. Highly recommended",
        "time": 1744566311,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Michael Smith",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109518665110356290591/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUUE5iV7cUNqETeXSR1KYWVpwK8YlwCoHz73uOcqQYTmWpm0L5f=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Met with Haley and from the first day I felt taken care of and she was attentive and professional. With a thought out plan for therapy and recovery, Haley got me from a broken elbow to back to work in 6 weeks. All the damage done from being casted was quickly tended to and I was able to get back to doing the things I love very quickly.\n\nA clean office , great attention to detail and a wonderful level of professionalism. I looked forward to meeting with her weekly, because what I needed was being taken care of properly.\n\nI recommend PhysioActif if you’re committed to getting better.",
        "time": 1723768683,
        "translated": false
      }
